%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b6d9004416d76c6499bb5cc8be070323, type: 3}
  m_Name: TakasuKatsuko
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CharacterInfo
  characterName: Takasu Katsuko
  description: All brawn, no brains. That's what she is. There isn't a better feeling
    than being stronger than everyone else. But status isn't the reason she became
    so strong. Her strength helps her knock any obstacles out of her sisters' way.
    She's the most hostile of the sisters, so nobody dares to mess with her, besides
    a few outliers. She isn't afraid to get violent as long as it protects the secure
    triangle the sisters have formed. But at worst, you'll get put six feet under.
    The only one that can take her on is Haruko, who is always trying to get her
    study.
  fullBody: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5405de38358b4c94fac9de5a17e17c79, type: 3}
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c514af5ff6f0fea4097444afaac67ece, type: 3}
  relationships:
  - name: Takasu Haruko
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94adab033d567a2489e342053d94579d, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 5
      comment: Sisters stick together, always!
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 5
      comment: I hate studying... Can't we just go to the mall instead?
    - name: 160
      storyProgression: 160
      relationship: 6
      comment: Oi... You're with that boy too much... I don't like it.
    - name: 180
      storyProgression: 180
      relationship: 8
      comment: Y-you can't do this to me! I don't have anyone else!
    - name: 190
      storyProgression: 190
      relationship: 7
      comment: I don't need you anymore.
    - name: 200
      storyProgression: 200
      relationship: 6
      comment: What... What's happening? Haruko... Help me...
    - name: 225
      storyProgression: 225
      relationship: 7
      comment: Is this how it's supposed to be, Haruko?
    - name: 240
      storyProgression: 240
      relationship: 8
      comment: It's not fair... This isn't right...
    - name: 250
      storyProgression: 250
      relationship: 9
      comment: Why did you have to push me away?
    - name: 275
      storyProgression: 275
      relationship: 10
      comment: WASN'T THIS WHAT YOU WANTED?
    - name: 280
      storyProgression: 280
      relationship: 9
      comment: Please, don't save me... I've been terrible to you all those years,
        haven't I?
    - name: 290
      storyProgression: 290
      relationship: 6
      comment: Why... After all the trouble I've caused... Why?
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 5
      comment: Thank you...
  - name: Takasu Mitsuko
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a37b3f5fd958004bba2c106a2580af1, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 5
      comment: You're always safe with me, Mitsuko!
    - name: 50
      storyProgression: 50
      relationship: 5
      comment: D-doesn't matter how many friends you have! I'm always watching over
        you!
    - name: 170
      storyProgression: 170
      relationship: 6
      comment: You don't need me anymore? That's fine, I guess...
    - name: 225
      storyProgression: 225
      relationship: 6
      comment: I can't let you see me like this...
    - name: 240
      storyProgression: 240
      relationship: 7
      comment: Why couldn't I be like you?
    - name: 250
      storyProgression: 250
      relationship: 8
      comment: Why was I the only one who couldn't...
    - name: 270
      storyProgression: 270
      relationship: 9
      comment: Don't tell anyone... Please... It's all I have...
    - name: 275
      storyProgression: 275
      relationship: 10
      comment: How could you do this to me, Mitsuko?
    - name: 280
      storyProgression: 280
      relationship: 9
      comment: I'm sorry... I'm such a mess...
    - name: 290
      storyProgression: 290
      relationship: 6
      comment: You don't have to...
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 5
      comment: Thank you...
  - name: Takasu Yuuchi
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 55a3c7e8fa975994dab138f1804d4834, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 3
      comment: He's small and cute. I could kick him around like a football.
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 3
      comment: I'm glad he's getting along with Mom. Better than I have.
    - name: 175
      storyProgression: 175
      relationship: 4
      comment: I'll look after you, Yuuchi.
    - name: 200
      storyProgression: 200
      relationship: 6
      comment: Don't look at me... I'm disgusting...
    - name: 250
      storyProgression: 250
      relationship: 8
      comment: How am I supposed to be your sister when I'm such a mess?
    - name: 275
      storyProgression: 275
      relationship: 10
      comment: Didn't I tell you not to look at me!?
    - name: 290
      storyProgression: 290
      relationship: 6
      comment: This isn't right... I'm supposed to be watching over you...
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 5
      comment: It's good to have you by my side.
  - name: Takasu Ryuuji
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d2082e7f2c181c4479e3e99a1996ad34, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 2
      comment: I mean, his food is good and he cleans up after me.
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 1
      comment: What else am I supposed to say about him?
    - name: 200
      storyProgression: 200
      relationship: 6
      comment: I... I don't want him to look at me that way...
    - name: 225
      storyProgression: 225
      relationship: 7
      comment: What can he even do? He's just a househusband!
    - name: 250
      storyProgression: 250
      relationship: 8
      comment: Useless!
    - name: 275
      storyProgression: 275
      relationship: 10
      comment: Leave me alone!
    - name: 280
      storyProgression: 280
      relationship: 9
      comment: I don't want your help, alright!?
    - name: 290
      storyProgression: 290
      relationship: 6
      comment: Am I still your little girl... After everything that's happened to
        me?
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 4
      comment: I... I need you, Dad.
  - name: Takasu Taiga
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dd6c719f114c5884bad0ca2d176f1648, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 7
      comment: Stop fussing over me!
    - name: 190
      storyProgression: 190
      relationship: 8
      comment: I don't need you anymore!
    - name: 225
      storyProgression: 225
      relationship: 9
      comment: I didn't ask you to suffer for me!
    - name: 250
      storyProgression: 250
      relationship: 10
      comment: Why did you even give birth to me?
    - name: 275
      storyProgression: 275
      relationship: 10
      comment: I don't want to see you ever again.
    - name: 280
      storyProgression: 280
      relationship: 9
      comment: There's nothing you can do to fix me.
    - name: 290
      storyProgression: 290
      relationship: 6
      comment: I'm sorry. I'm sorry for everything.
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 3
      comment: I'll be fine on my own... No, I'll even make you proud. Just watch.
  - name: Koigakubo Yuri
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d411c21d515fe4a4cae0fffbbc885d31, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 7
      comment: This woman taught Mom? So what?
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 8
      comment: I'll do whatever I want! I don't care about school anyway!
    - name: 200
      storyProgression: 200
      relationship: 7
      comment: If I'm so troublesome, then leave me alone!
    - name: 225
      storyProgression: 225
      relationship: 6
      comment: Please... Just leave me alone...
    - name: 250
      storyProgression: 250
      relationship: 9
      comment: I don't want to go to anymore classes!
    - name: 290
      storyProgression: 290
      relationship: 6
      comment: After everything, you're still...
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 1
      comment: I... I won't disappoint you.
  - name: Sagawa Kaito
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c9602679b725d884db59cada9692373a, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 6
      comment: Ugh... Boys...
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 7
      comment: That idiot better not do anything to my sister.
    - name: 160
      storyProgression: 160
      relationship: 8
      comment: Who even are you!? This doesn't make any sense!
    - name: 180
      storyProgression: 180
      relationship: 9
      comment: Stay away from my sister!
    - name: 190
      storyProgression: 190
      relationship: 7
      comment: Whatever. You can have her. I don't care.
    - name: 250
      storyProgression: 250
      relationship: 10
      comment: It's all your fault... I'm all alone because of you...
    - name: 275
      storyProgression: 275
      relationship: 9
      comment: My feelings won't change, even with your help.
    - name: 280
      storyProgression: 280
      relationship: 16
      comment: Why couldn't I find someone like you?
    - name: 290
      storyProgression: 290
      relationship: 6
      comment: I've only caused you trouble...
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 1
      comment: I think I'm okay having you around.
  - name: Ninomae Arisa
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1801885d89f72374e8d8f225007555ab, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 0
      comment: Who?
    - name: 10
      storyProgression: 10
      relationship: 6
      comment: I don't hold back against girls. If she hurts Mitsuko I'm cracking
        her skull open.
    - name: 25
      storyProgression: 25
      relationship: 6
      comment: Urgh... I don't like how Mitsuko hangs with her all the time...
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 6
      comment: I don't care how friendly she is. There has to be a catch.
    - name: 150
      storyProgression: 150
      relationship: 0
      comment: Whatever. We're nothing alike. I won't force myself to be friendly
        with her.
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 1
      comment: I suppose it's nice to know another friendly face.
  - name: Kishida Mie
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 75a38326ef94e1c499364e6bea112370, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 0
      comment: She looks a little creepy.
    - name: 35
      storyProgression: 35
      relationship: 6
      comment: Why would Mitsuko be friends with a perv like her?
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 6
      comment: Oi... The way she touches Mitsuko... Isn't that a bit much!?
    - name: 150
      storyProgression: 150
      relationship: 0
      comment: Whatever... As long as she isn't giving Mitsuko any trouble.
    - name: 160
      storyProgression: 160
      relationship: 0
      comment: She didn't seem too weird when she came over for a sleepover.
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 1
      comment: At least she's a good person...
  - name: Koigakubo Tarou
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6b80ba0c077c73d4aa5699e5c44366b9, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 0
      comment: Having your mom as a teacher is a little weird, isn't it?
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 6
      comment: He's not a talker... But I guess I don't have any complaints?
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 1
      comment: He's more caring than I thought.
  - name: Takano Saki
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a197f9d1e638c64499a9da8564c2c785, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 1
      comment: Hm. She's pretty cute. Like a little hamster.
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 11
      comment: I suppose it is quite nice having a cute face around here.
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 3
      comment: I'm glad she has my back.
  - name: Yoshida Satoshi
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a1f794b0c2aed9d45b59d7b4572c8dfb, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 0
      comment: Urgh... Boys...
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 6
      comment: Does he think I'm some kind of circus animal?
    - name: 225
      storyProgression: 225
      relationship: 16
      comment: I can't take your kindness... Don't look at me...
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 11
      comment: Maybe when I'm ready... But not right now...
  - name: Kogarashi Hitomi
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fed86471980176d498fa75256439b42d, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 0
      comment: Who?
    - name: 100
      storyProgression: 100
      relationship: 0
      comment: Woah, he's hot.
    - name: 150
      storyProgression: 150
      relationship: 6
      comment: He's nice, but I can't take any attention away from my sisters.
    - name: 180
      storyProgression: 180
      relationship: 11
      comment: He really understands me?
    - name: 190
      storyProgression: 190
      relationship: 12
      comment: I think I've finally found the one!
    - name: 200
      storyProgression: 200
      relationship: 16
      comment: H-huh? N-no! You can't! You can't...
    - name: 225
      storyProgression: 225
      relationship: 17
      comment: But you were supposed to be the one...
    - name: 240
      storyProgression: 240
      relationship: 18
      comment: I want it to stop but I don't want to be alone...
    - name: 250
      storyProgression: 250
      relationship: 19
      comment: I can't lift a fist anymore... I don't want to be a monster anymore...
        But...
    - name: 265
      storyProgression: 265
      relationship: 20
      comment: Just do what you want with me... I have nobody but you...
    - name: 275
      storyProgression: 275
      relationship: 20
      comment: What do I do, Hitomi?
    - name: 280
      storyProgression: 280
      relationship: 20
      comment: Where are we going, Hitomi?
    - name: 290
      storyProgression: 290
      relationship: 20
      comment: I'm sorry, Hitomi. It's my fault too.
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 20
      comment: I don't know if I ever want to see you again.
  - name: Takasu Yasuko
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 005537d58d9b8f145b2a757e4b1b5d30, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 4
      comment: She's a lot of fun!
  - name: Kitamura Yuusaku
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: de13e7c31359b3641b7ba1e869733eeb, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 1
      comment: Uhh... Who? Well, he seems friendly at least.
  - name: Kushieda Minori
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dc268a8534575254dac472a77c2d34d6, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 1
      comment: I'm no good with names. But I like her personality.
    - name: 175
      storyProgression: 175
      relationship: 2
      comment: Can't go wrong with her.
    - name: 300
      storyProgression: 300
      relationship: 2
      comment: Hope she isn't upset I quit softball.
  - name: Kawashima Ami
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3c892378169223b49bb7bc0ad680814e, type: 2}
    stages:
    - name: 0
      storyProgression: 0
      relationship: 3
      comment: It's always a fun time when she's around!
